{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation complete in worktree fix-3ff9; RED->GREEN per plan.\n\nRED: tests/unit/test_push_expected_contention_quiet.py failed 5/7 on unfixed code for the pinned reasons (WARNING at push.py:323 terminal-after-recovery with raw \"! [rejected]\" stderr and the \"..HEAD\" suffix; recovery-leg transport notices at WARNING; backlog_grew absent; strict message pinned old wording).\n\nGREEN (all changes logging/wording only - no behavior, classification, retry, or marker change):\n- push_state.unpushed_summary now reads \"(N unpushed commits on the local tickets branch ahead of origin/tickets; committed locally, they publish on the next successful push)\" - names the branch, no bare ..HEAD, self-healing contract in-text.\n- push_state.backlog_grew reads the PREVIOUS marker's unpushed count (state the marker already stored) before record_failure overwrites it; ambiguity resolves to False.\n- push_classify._terminal_severity: WARNING only for a policy decline in the terminal stderr or a PROVEN-growing backlog (suffix gains \"the backlog GREW since the previous failure\"); otherwise INFO with \"expected under concurrent tickets writers - no action needed\".\n- push.py: both terminal contention sites (retry-exhausted \"failed after N retries\" and \"terminal push failed after recovery\") now logger.log at that severity; both pinned literals appended-to, never reworded - epoch-guard negative assertions honored, not retargeted.\n- Mid-retry transient-transport notices demoted to INFO at all three sites (push_classify._retry_transport_or_stop, push_recovery fetch-leg and merge-leg), wording \"retrying automatically, no action needed\".\n- Consciously retargeted pins in the same change: test_push_strict.py (capture at INFO + level assertion), test_push_strict_happy.py and test_push_rejection_surfacing.py (new summary wording).\n\nVerification: new suite 7/7; targeted push/epoch-guard selection 107 passed with ONE failure - test_inline_write_push::test_a_write_pushing_to_the_origin_leaves_no_detached_upkeep - proven PRE-EXISTING: reproduced 2/2 on unmodified origin/main (a1a6a151bc) with baseline sources, passes alone and in all probed pairs. Filed as hypodermal-cacotopic-zenaida (d720-fc72-3763-4cac), linked discovered_from. make lint PASS; make typecheck PASS; complexity ratchet: new=0 increased=0 stale=1 (a function got simpler - sanctioned, baseline untouched).\n\nNext: commit with rebar-ticket trailer + DCO, push gerrit HEAD:refs/for/main, wait LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1, Submit, then close."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787338427684568001,"uuid":"4f96658c-d080-4df1-a085-11ca029d9c76"}